<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="refund-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">Refund Policy</span>
      <h1 id="refund-heading">Refund Policy</h1>
      <p>This refund policy explains how refunds are handled for paid mock test access and course purchases on MockOrbit.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-block">
      <h2>Refund eligibility</h2>
      <p>Refunds may be provided in cases where a paid service was not delivered or access could not be granted due to a platform error.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-block">
      <h2>Request process</h2>
      <p>To request a refund, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@mockorbit.in">hello@mockorbit.in</a> with your payment details and a brief explanation.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-block">
      <h2>Processing time</h2>
      <p>Refund requests are typically reviewed and processed within 5–7 business days after verification.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-block">
      <h2>Exceptions</h2>
      <p>Refunds are issued at MockOrbit’s discretion and may not apply to accounts with misuse or policy violations.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
